   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking the time",
     "texto": [
      "**Która godzina?** asks what time it is now. **O której godzinie?** asks at what time something happens.",
      "Full hours use the feminine form: **Jest ósma** («It's eight o'clock»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Saying at what time",
     "texto": [
      "After **o**, the form also changes: **o ósmej** means «at eight» and **o siódmej**, «at seven».",
      "This is unlike English, where «eight» and «seven» stay the same after «at»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Days of the week",
     "texto": [
      "To say the days, you say **w poniedziałek**, **w środę**, **w sobotę** or **w niedzielę**.",
      "Some forms change after **w**; learn the full expressions by heart."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
